                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "There isn't a way to specify the dbus interface in a way that we can avoid this configuration?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meson.options",
                    "line": 68,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Matt Spinler",
                        "email": "spinler@us.ibm.com",
                        "username": "spinler"
                    },
                    "message": "It will be on the same object path as the Item.System interface.  Was hoping to shortcut having to look for that first to simplify everything.  After I resolve your deadlock question in the other review I will revisit this."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meson.options",
                    "line": 68,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Matt Spinler",
                        "email": "spinler@us.ibm.com",
                        "username": "spinler"
                    },
                    "message": "I've been thinking about this.  If I were to try to find the path for the Item.System interface, I would have to first deal with the case of it not being there right away so I'd have to try later, and then also still have the same problem with the Position interface not being on that path yet.\n\nSo for now I'm inclined to leave it."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meson.options",
                    "line": 68,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Matt Spinler",
                        "email": "spinler@us.ibm.com",
                        "username": "spinler"
                    },
                    "message": "I can remove it now that the position is just being read from a file."
                }
            ],
